def knapsack(items, capacity):
    """0/1 knapsack. items = [(weight, value)]. Returns the maximum total value with total weight <= capacity."""
    best = [0] * (capacity + 1)
    for w, v in items:
        for c in range(capacity, w - 1, -1):
            best[c] = max(best[c], best[c - w] + v)
    return best[capacity]
```

